# The images and documents that used to be served from this site and now live on the CDN
# (cdn.franciscosolis.cl, built from the `cdn/` directory — see src/lib/cdn.ts).
#
# They stay because these URLs were published where this repository cannot reach them: email
# signatures pasted into other mailboxes, link previews and search results that cached the old
# og:image, and copies of the brand guide that point at /brand/BRAND.md. A 301 sends each one to
# the same path on the CDN. `/brand` itself is a page of the site and is deliberately not matched.
/brand/svg/*                          https://cdn.franciscosolis.cl/brand/svg/:splat                    301
/brand/png/*                          https://cdn.franciscosolis.cl/brand/png/:splat                    301
/brand/webp/*                         https://cdn.franciscosolis.cl/brand/webp/:splat                   301
/brand/BRAND.md                       https://cdn.franciscosolis.cl/brand/BRAND.md                      301
/brand/franciscosolis-brand-kit.zip   https://cdn.franciscosolis.cl/brand/franciscosolis-brand-kit.zip  301
/badges/*                             https://cdn.franciscosolis.cl/badges/:splat                       301
/profile-picture.webp                 https://cdn.franciscosolis.cl/profile-picture.webp                301
/profile-picture-full.webp            https://cdn.franciscosolis.cl/profile-picture-full.webp           301
